   <narrative xml:lang="FI">GortsON: Sport for Gender Equality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local cooperation in Armenia on 2022-2023. Girls of Armenia leadership sport education foundation&#xb4; (GOALS) project GortsON: Sports for Gender Equality, Girls leadership and wellbeing in rural Armenia. The project is about empowering young girls (12-17 years) to become the factors of change by developing knowledge and skills about social-emotianal, physical, reproproductive health and an agency for active self-leadership.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">PYM-hanke Armeniassa 2022-2023. Girls of Armenia leadership sport educational foundationin (GOALS) hanke GortsON: Sports for Gender Equality, Girls leadership and wellbeing in rural Armenia. Hankkeen tavoitteena on voimaannuttaa ja tukea 12-17-vuotiaita tytt&#xf6;j&#xe4;, edist&#xe4;&#xe4; sukupuolten tasa-arvoa ja naisten asemaa ja (lis&#xe4;&#xe4;ntymis)terveytt&#xe4; erityisesti maaseutualueilla jalkapallon harrastustoiminnan kautta.</narrative>
  </description>
